IMPORTANT RADAR IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENT

For m2, do not create a custom imitation of the radar background.

Use the official open-source React Bits Radar component from:

https://reactbits.dev/backgrounds/radar?color=29ff55

Requirements:

* Open the React Bits Radar page.
* Copy/use the official component implementation, props, CSS/Tailwind structure, and required dependencies exactly as provided.
* Use color: #29ff55.
* Preserve the original animation behavior, radar sweep, grid, glow, fade/falloff, and background behavior.
