* Integrate it as a reusable component, for example:
  components/backgrounds/Radar.tsx
  or
  components/backgrounds/Radar.jsx
* Only modify styling where required to fit the existing portfolio layout, without changing the original radar animation logic.
* Document the source in a comment:
  “Radar background based on the official React Bits Radar component.”
